2\"></text></svg> ve onlar için Allaha istiğfar eyle-zirâ istiyzan her ne kadar özri kavî ile sadâkata müstenid olsa da Dünya işini Âhıret işine takdim etmek gibi bir kusur şaibesinden hâli kalmaz. Sen istiğfar edersen<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"173\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 173.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 32.2 32.2 44.2 61.4 61.4 69.7 78.0 78.0 84.7 102.7 109.4 109.4 109.4 116.2 123.7 139.4 139.4 150.0 150.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.2 84.7 102.7 139.4 156.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şübhe yok ki Allah, gafurdur ve rahîmdir. -Bu noktada Resulullaha hıtabdan ümmetine hıtaba iltifat ile buyuruluyor ki :</p><p>Ey müslimanlar! 63.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"252\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 251.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 44.3 44.3 51.0 66.7 66.7 77.3 85.4 96.7 96.7 104.3 111.7 127.4 134.3 134.3 141.0 150.0 150.0 166.4 173.3 181.4 181.4 188.3 195.0 195.0 207.7 223.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.4 51.0 85.4 96.7 127.4 141.0 188.3 207.7 228.0 235.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Peygamberin da'vetini, duasını aranızda<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 176.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 37.6 37.6 44.3 60.0 60.0 69.0 69.0 81.0 81.0 95.3 95.3 102.0 117.7 117.7 124.6 124.6 131.3 140.3 140.3 149.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\">